# Run-state e2e credentials written by hugmesh-generator's `make stack-seed`
# (tests/stack/e2e-password.sh). This repo only READS it (e2e/tests/helpers/
# roles.ts), never writes it, but it must still never be committed. No
# leading slash: this repo's e2e/ runs Playwright with a different cwd than
# the repo root, and roles.ts walks up from cwd looking for this filename.
.e2e-credentials
